{"id":"383164042b66f617","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-prop-normal.md","title":"Normal Space","display":"prop-normal — Normal Space","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-normal","aliases":["58-prop-normal"],"display":"prop-normal — Normal Space","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-normal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-normal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-normal — Normal Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,F,G,U,W\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,F,G,U,W\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (normal-space predicate characterized here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Normal}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\forall F,G\\subseteq X\\;\n\\Bigl(\nX\\setminus F\\in\\tau\n\\land X\\setminus G\\in\\tau\n\\land F\\cap G=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\exists U,W\\in\\tau\\;\n(F\\subseteq U\\land G\\subseteq W\\land U\\cap W=\\varnothing)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Normal}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\forall F,G\\subseteq X\\;\n\\Bigl(\nX\\setminus F\\in\\tau\n\\land X\\setminus G\\in\\tau\n\\land F\\cap G=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\exists U,W\\in\\tau\\;\n(F\\subseteq U\\land G\\subseteq W\\land U\\cap W=\\varnothing)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This uses the convention that normality itself need not include <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1\">\\(T_1\\)</span>; normal plus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1\">\\(T_1\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_4\">\\(T_4\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Metric spaces are normal.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,F,G,U,W\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Normal}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow&\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\forall F,G\\subseteq X\\;\n\\Bigl(\nX\\setminus F\\in\\tau\n\\land X\\setminus G\\in\\tau\n\\land F\\cap G=\\varnothing\\\\\n&\\to\n\\exists U,W\\in\\tau\\;\n(F\\subseteq U\\land G\\subseteq W\\land U\\cap W=\\varnothing)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T_1","display":false},{"tex":"T_1","display":false},{"tex":"T_4","display":false}],"bytes":1020,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3982","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-prop-normal.md|58-prop-normal]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["815e63e5071e7b58"]}